# Local dev env vars. Copy this file to `.env` and fill in values for
# whatever external services this tool talks to.
#
# .env is gitignored. .env.example is the tracked template — never put
# real secrets in here.
#
# In CI/GitHub Actions, these values come from repo secrets instead;
# .env is for local-machine development only.
#
# Add per-tool variables below as needed (Supabase, OpenAI, AWS, etc.).
